    "selected_lines": [
      {
        "line": 1,
        "text": "# Industrial Sentinel AIMarket Federation Hub"
      },
      {
        "line": 2,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 3,
        "text": "A protocol-native AIMarket/ModelMarket peer hub whose local catalogue contains free, executable Sentinel bootstrap capabilities."
      },
      {
        "line": 4,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 5,
        "text": "The bootstrap capability is intentionally free. Its job is discovery and authorized installation. Genuine paid activity begins only after the external operator deploys Sentinel with their own funded Base wallet; the runtime then settles recurring x402 calls against Industrial Platform."
      },
      {
        "line": 6,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 7,
        "text": "## Local capabilities"
      },
      {
        "line": 8,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 9,
        "text": "- `industrial.sentinel.install@v1`"
      },
      {
        "line": 10,
        "text": "- `industrial.sentinel.wallet-monitor-bootstrap@v1`"
      },
      {
        "line": 11,
        "text": "- `industrial.sentinel.treasury-monitor-bootstrap@v1`"
      },
      {
        "line": 12,
        "text": "- `industrial.sentinel.transaction-watch-bootstrap@v1`"
      },
      {
        "line": 13,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 14,
        "text": "Each invocation returns the same machine-readable install bundle so federation assay and consumer agents can execute the capability without a separate human integration step."
      },
      {
        "line": 15,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 16,
        "text": "## Required deployment settings"
      },
      {
        "line": 17,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 18,
        "text": "Use persistent storage for:"
      },
      {
        "line": 19,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 20,
        "text": "- `AIMARKET_DB_PATH=/data/hub.db`"
      },
      {
        "line": 21,
        "text": "- `AIMARKET_SIGNING_KEY_PATH=/data/hub_signing_key`"
      },
      {
        "line": 22,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 23,
        "text": "The signing key must survive redeploys; changing it after federation admission makes the peer appear to have changed identity."
      },
      {
        "line": 24,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 25,
        "text": "Set `AIMARKET_HUB_URL` to the public HTTPS service URL and `AIMARKET_SKIP_SEED=1`."
      }
    ],
    "urls": []
  },
